  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この後おじさん組で二次会やるんだけど、\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんも来ない？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "面子はわたなべさんとしんげんさん、\nはざまさんとくずのはね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "二次会の店は今、\n渡辺サンが探してくれているが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "プロデューサーはこいつが気になって、\nそれどころじゃなさそうだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こいつ……？　ああ、この『挑戦状』か。\n男極リーグ？　っていうアイドルの大会だっけ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "アイドル業界ってのは、\nこういうイベント事が頻繁に起きるから面白いな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "さすがに挑戦状が届くイベントは、\nそうそう無いだろうけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これを真っ先に見つけたJupiterが、\n「俺たちが先陣を切る！」って意気込んでたなぁ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いやあ、若いと勢いがあっていいねえ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だが、第一戦目が『モテ部門』だと知って、\n動揺してたな。天ヶ瀬が。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "打ち上げ中も作戦会議に夢中だったぜ。\n微笑ましい限りだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_c:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 14,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……あの、次郎さん、雨彦さん。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
